From 2fea155fd7d2bc83ca4d843e5136321101672229 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:41:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/55] fix-data-3: old links resolve on a hash change too;
 shift-pay Juice line fits 280 px; registry and fixtures for norm-12

- app.js: resolveOldFilterKeys also runs when the hash changes on the open board; a city's alias is its
  disambiguated form ('Columbus, OH'), not 'City, <country code>' (which read NVIDIA's old 'New York, US' as the city).
- The shift-pay line reads 'Gross pay includes top shift pay.' (the longer forms wrap on the 280 px Galaxy Fold).
- data/freshness.json: the gazetteer is 341 cities; line references moved (registry.js --lines --write, --docs --write).
- test/fixtures/refresh/jobs: regenerated at norm-12 with make-fixtures.mjs (the fixtures are current-version snapshots).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014jaqot5Ddmi7Co6CofBiyc
(cherry picked from commit 09fa75391f3ef2a0530b4f3317817bb360691011)
